name mynsfc
category Package
revision 60280
shortdesc XeLaTeX template for writing the main body of NSFC proposals
longdesc The package provides a XeLaTeX template for writing the main
longdesc body of National Natural Science Foundation of China (NSFC)
longdesc proposals, which are allowed to apply online. The package
longdesc defines styles of the outlines and uses BibLaTeX/biber for the
longdesc management of references.
